  "description": "Operator-facing observability for the depot chat agent's SQL mode (PLAN.md S5a). Backed by the favonius_agent_* and favonius_agent_sql_* Prometheus metrics from src/monitoring/metrics.py. Two panels are intentional TODOs: failure_reason (only an agent_runs column today, no exporter) and shadow-suite pass rate (GitHub Actions history). See '# S5a followups' in CLAUDE.md.",
