        "x": 0,
        "y": 8
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "### ⚠️ TODO — Failures by `failure_reason`\n\n**No Prometheus metric backs this yet.** `failure_reason` is only a column on the `agent_runs` table (classified in `src/api/agent/audit.py::classify_failure`), and there is **no `postgres_exporter`** in this monitoring stack to scrape it.\n\n**To populate this panel, do one of:**\n1. Add a `postgres_exporter` scraping `SELECT failure_reason, count(*) FROM agent_runs WHERE failure_reason IS NOT NULL GROUP BY 1`, then point this panel at a Postgres datasource; **or**\n2. Emit a new `favonius_agent_failure_reason_total{reason}` counter at the `classify_failure` write site and query `sum(increase(favonius_agent_failure_reason_total[$time_range])) by (reason)`.\n\n**Seven values:** `validator_rejected`, `executor_timeout`, `empty_result`, `budget_exceeded`, `tool_error`, `llm_error`, `other`.\n\n_Tracked under `# S5a followups` in CLAUDE.md._"
      }
    },
