        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "### ⚠️ TODO — Shadow suite pass rate (last 14 nights)\n\n**No Prometheus metric backs this yet.** The nightly live shadow suite runs in the `.github/workflows/agent-sql-shadow.yml` GitHub Action; its pass/fail history lives in GitHub, which Grafana cannot query natively.\n\n**To populate this panel, do one of:**\n1. Have the nightly job push a `favonius_agent_sql_shadow_pass_ratio` gauge (`passed / total`) to a Prometheus Pushgateway, then graph it over `[14d]`; **or**\n2. Install a GitHub datasource plugin and query the workflow-run conclusions for `agent-sql-shadow.yml`.\n\n_Tracked under `# S5a followups` in CLAUDE.md._"
